  "title": "Lady Yohl Ik'nal, ruler of Palenque (583-604)",
  "summary": "Lady Yohl Ik'nal ruled the Maya city of Palenque in her own right for about 21 years after acceding in December 583, and is one of few Classic Maya women known to hold the full royal title. Palenque suffered a military assault during her reign, probably in 599. She died in 604.",
