  "reviewer_note": "Least sure of the 599 attacker and date: Mesoweb gives 21 April 599 (Martin and Grube) and reports an older reading of 23 April, so the summary says only 'probably 599'. The Met essay could not be opened (HTTP 429). Her parentage (daughter or sister of Kan Bahlam I) is uncertain and left out. Wikidata supports the pin only. Mexicolore (an educational site) confirms the 583 accession and 21-year reign only; its other family claims are not used.",
